      "content": "The argument that ESG distracts from fiduciary duty is outdated, as modern fiduciary responsibility *includes* managing long-term systemic risk. Ignoring environmental and social instability is the definition of poor risk management, which directly threatens shareholder value. By integrating ESG, you are proactively de-risking the company against regulatory shifts and climate-related disruptions, which ultimately protects and enhances long-term returns.",
      "source": "target",
